04_00000":"Hi!\\nHow’s it going?\\rYou’re in the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group with\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} as leader, right?\\rWould you like to leave that group\\nand join another one? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00001":"Hi!\\nHow’s it going?\\rYou’re in the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group with\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} as leader, right?\\rWould you like to leave that group\\nand make a new one? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00002":"Hey, you! I know it’s a little sudden,\\nbut would you like to join a group?\\rIf you join a group, you can compete\\nor cooperate with fellow members.\\rIt’s a lot of fun. Want to join? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00003":"Which group would you like to join? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00004":"Oh. That’s too bad.","msg_0204_00005":"Oh, you want to make a new group?\\nSure thing!\\rThe group you made before will be\\ndisbanded, though. Is that OK? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00006":"Cool! What do you want to name\\nyour group?","msg_0204_00007":"The {STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0} group, huh?\\nThat’s a great name!\\rThe leader is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\\nI hope the group gets more members.","msg_0204_00008":"The {STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0} group?\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} is the leader.\\fWill you join this group? {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00009":"OK! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is now a member\\nof the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group.","msg_0204_00010":"When you form or join a new group,\\nbe sure to visit any Union Room.\\rMix your records with group members,\\nand you’ll become integrated.\\rWhen you’re in the same group,\\nevents can happen simultaneously.\\rIt makes things a lot more fun\\nplaying in a group!\\rAnyone can make a new group, and\\nanyone can join.\\rI hope you recruit lots of friends\\nso everyone can have fun! {YESNO 0}","msg_0204_00011":"MAKE GROUP","msg_0204_00012":"JOIN GROUP","msg_0204_00013":"INFO","msg_0204_00014":"EXIT","msg_0204_00015":"{STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0}\\nGROUP","msg_0204_00016":"{STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0}\\nGROUP","msg_0204_00017":"{STRVAR_34 3, 2, 0}\\nGROUP","msg_0204_00018":"{STRVAR_34 3, 3, 0}\\nGROUP","msg_0204_00019":"{STRVAR_34 3, 4, 0}\\nGROUP","msg_0204_00020":"{STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0} GROUP","msg_0204_00021":"{STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} GROUP","msg_0204_00022":"{STRVAR_34 3, 2, 0} GROUP","msg_0204_00023":"{STRVAR_34 3, 3, 0} GROUP","msg_0204_00024":"{STRVAR_34 3, 4, 0} GROUP","msg_0204_00025":"EXIT","msg_0204_00026":"That group?\\nDidn’t {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} make it already?","msg_0204_00027":"Isn’t there already another group\\nwith that name?"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_0143_000":0}}
